7. CALLING STRATEGIES

Initially implement two calling strategies:

A. MANUAL CALL

Manual calling must allow an authorized user to manually select/dial a phone number.

The following roles can potentially have manual calling permission:

- Super Admin
- Manager
- Admin
- User

Actual access must depend on the permission system.

Manual call flow:

Lead
↓
View customer information
↓
Click CALL
↓
Call initiated
↓
Conversation
↓
Call ends
↓
Select disposition
↓
Add notes
↓
Save call result

