8. PREVIEW AUTO DIAL

Implement Preview Auto Dial mode.

This is NOT predictive dialing initially.

The system should first show the next lead/customer information to the agent.

Example:

Next Lead

Name: Rahul Kumar
Mobile: 98XXXXXXXX
Loan Amount: ₹85,000
City: Delhi
Product: Personal Loan
Due Date: 25-09-2026

Buttons:

[CALL]

After the call ends:

[Disposition]
[Notes]
[SAVE & NEXT]

After saving the result, the next lead should be presented automatically.

The auto-dial engine must respect:

- User assignment
- Campaign status
- Lead status
- Calling permissions
- Call availability
- Callback schedules
- Duplicate prevention
- Do-not-call/block status if implemented
- Concurrent call restrictions

Keep the architecture extensible so future strategies can be added:

- Manual
- Preview
- Progressive
- Power Dialer
- Predictive Dialer

